  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_81f8990e-6de2-4223-9b21-e1bf22d503fe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"472\"></p><p>本模組現已推出 TERRAFIRMAGREG 相容版本！請點此查看：<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-of-terrafirmagreg\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraFirmaGreg 史詩騎士&nbsp;</a></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_2ced21a1-0607-42c4-bfeb-9346947b31c6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"62\"></p><p>本模組旨在讓<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-armor-and-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">史詩騎士：盾牌、盔甲與武器</a></strong>及其擴充模組能最大程度相容於<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrafirmacraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraFirmaCraft</a></strong>。截至<strong>3.0</strong>版本，<strong>TerraFirma 史詩騎士</strong>已包含<strong><em>900+</em></strong>種物品，涵蓋<strong>TFC</strong>生存模式中所有材質的<em>武器</em>、<em>盾牌</em>與<em>盔甲</em>。<strong>史詩騎士</strong>與<strong>史詩騎士：古典遺產</strong>的素材均經過重製以符合<strong>TFC</strong>美術風格，相關物品數值也重新平衡以契合<strong>TFC</strong>玩法。盔甲屬性可透過設定檔自訂！</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_975b12a1-f75e-40a4-8214-974698f1d3b4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"62\"></p><p>自<strong>3.0</strong>版本起，<strong>TerraFirma 史詩騎士</strong>模組已原生支援<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a></strong>，且應不會與其他模組發生衝突。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_e0572cef-4c09-4f4d-b7a4-ff41983b0d5b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"66\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_274c52a1-3723-4435-b7c3-f21bb3ef0624.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"942\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_4fbbf070-ada0-4680-abbb-d890cb756057.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"65\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_c578c568-bb70-4f76-a01e-5bec8db26ff6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"710\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_16e51fed-094c-4478-b404-8d75e530a1e8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"67\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_5d77e783-308e-4640-ba39-446abb87407a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"260\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_32b0f980-0c3b-4ad4-946e-fc8787c94b3e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"571\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_3531e109-b66f-441c-a432-f631c79af3de.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"66\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_70c95701-bf7a-4465-8839-c804588652fa.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"436\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_7ed83493-8ecd-43be-a973-aa0971ffe128.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"65\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_c2005522-0356-477d-961c-b8d23aede9e1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"712\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_b5637dd0-782e-4a25-b383-bf4141bd9adc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"476\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_bd8c0bcd-6573-493b-a6f4-76cf15ef5891.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"335\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_0434a30e-7e4f-49b6-8b9e-adbcbb28eb61.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"65\"></p><p>目前開發藍圖如下（笑）：</p><ul>\n<li>新增對史詩騎士擴充模組的支援</li>\n</ul><p>不過短期內不會實裝。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1092010/description_a1ededac-9c40-4f41-9faf-76c51167c006.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"65\"></p><p>衷心感謝<strong>Magistu</strong>願意解答關於其模組內部機制的所有疑問，感謝<strong>SomeIdiot13</strong>（當前Discord暱稱）協助除錯與測試，感謝<strong>StaxiHD</strong>協助紋理製作與德文翻譯，感謝<strong>MrHiTech</strong>創建了最終促成此模組誕生的絕佳資料包。另感謝<strong>Yappit1</strong>、<strong>Seagullible</strong>、<strong>sossololpipi</strong>在遊玩<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/terrafirmacultures-s2\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraFirmaCultures</a>時協助測試與除錯。</p>",
